+/// `window_id`.
+///
+/// A sheet (the Save panel on a document window) is hosted by another process:
+/// `AXWindow` on its controls and `_AXUIElementGetWindow` on the sheet name the
+/// sheet's own surface, not the document window the sheet hangs from, although
+/// the sheet is an `AXParent` descendant of that window. Only a window-role
